# 1MAX: one extra ball and the 3011 text (AddExtraBall, dragon_core.cpp).
# The 3011 text is shown for 2 s from the frame the 4th character is typed (frame 33, text.jsonl):
# the expect is exactly frame 33 (deterministic under fixed_dt); the extra_balls expect is at 70.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
30 type 1MAX
70 expect extra_balls == 1
33 expect text info_text_box display id 3011
80 quit
